### 1. Create a New Post (Published)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "title": "Spring Boot Tutorial: Advanced JPA",
  "description": "Learn how to use JPA Specifications and Custom Queries effectively.",
  "content": "In this tutorial, we will dive deep into Java Persistence API. We will cover CriteriaBuilder and JPQL. It is essential for backend developers.",
  "imageUrl": "https://picsum.photos/id/10/200/300",
  "status": "PUBLISHED",
  "category": {
    "name": "Programming"
  },
  "tags": [
    { "name": "Java" },
    { "name": "Database" }
  ]
}

> {%
    client.global.set("postId", response.body.id);
    client.global.set("categoryId", response.body.category.id);
    client.global.set("tagId", response.body.tags[0].id);
%}

###

### 2. Get Post Feed (No Filters)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 3. Search Mixed (Default: Title + Description)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts?query=Tutorial
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 4. Search by TITLE Only
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts?query=Advanced&searchType=TITLE
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 5. Search by DESCRIPTION (via MIXED type)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts?query=Specifications&searchType=MIXED
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 6. Filter by Category Only
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts?categoryId={{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 7. Complex Filter: Mixed Search + Category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts?query=JPA&searchType=MIXED&categoryId={{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 8. Complex Filter: Tag + Title Search
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts?query=Spring&searchType=TITLE&tagId={{tagId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 9. Update Post (Direct Hotfix)
# Simulates updating a live post directly without a draft (e.g. typo fix)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "title": "Spring Boot Tutorial: Advanced JPA (Hotfix)",
  "description": "Updated description.",
  "content": "Content updated.",
  "imageUrl": "https://picsum.photos/id/11/200/300",
  "status": "PUBLISHED",
  "category": { "name": "Programming" },
  "tags": [ { "name": "Java" } ]
}

###

### 10. Create a New Independent Draft
# Test flexible validation (missing tags/description is allowed for DRAFT)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "title": "My Rough Ideas",
  "content": "This is a work in progress. I will finish it later.",
  "status": "DRAFT",
  "imageUrl": "",
  "category": {
    "name": "Journal"
  }
}

> {%
    client.global.set("draftId", response.body.id);
%}

###

### 11. Get Drafts List (Paged)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/drafts?page=0&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 12. Get My Published Posts (Paged)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/published?page=0&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

# =============================================================================
# REVISION WORKFLOW TESTS (Fork & Merge)
# =============================================================================

### 13. Create Revision (Fork)
# Creates a DRAFT copy of the Published Post ({{postId}})
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}/revision
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

> {%
    client.global.set("revisionId", response.body.id);
%}

### 14a. Update Revision - Round 1 (Save Draft)
# User types something but isn't finished.
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/{{revisionId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "title": "Spring Boot Tutorial: Version 2.0 (Work in Progress)",
  "content": "I started writing the new section...",
  "status": "DRAFT",
  "imageUrl": "",
  "category": { "name": "Programming" },
  "tags": [ { "name": "Java" } ]
}

### 14b. Update Revision - Round 2 (Save Draft Again)
# User comes back later and adds more content. Original is STILL untouched.
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/{{revisionId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "title": "Spring Boot Tutorial: Version 2.0 (Almost Done)",
  "content": "I started writing the new section... and now I finished the conclusion.",
  "status": "DRAFT",
  "imageUrl": "",
  "category": { "name": "Programming" },
  "tags": [ { "name": "Java" } ]
}

### 15. Publish the Revision (Final Merge)
# User is finally happy. This overwrites the original post.
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/{{revisionId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "title": "Spring Boot Tutorial: Version 2.0 (Final)",
  "content": "I started writing the new section... and now I finished the conclusion. It is live!",
  "status": "PUBLISHED",
  "description": "New Description Live.",
  "imageUrl": "https://picsum.photos/id/12/200/300",
  "category": { "name": "Programming" },
  "tags": [ { "name": "Java" } ]
}